  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3480,
      "text": "Reading for writing. Activity to."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 4560,
      "end_ms": 6020,
      "text": "Read the passage."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 7640,
      "end_ms": 9860,
      "text": "What happened to Dodo's?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 11800,
      "end_ms": 13680,
      "text": "As dead as a dodo."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 15480,
      "end_ms": 19140,
      "text": "Are you looking at me? Do you know me?"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 20120,
      "end_ms": 27900,
      "text": "I'm a dodo. You may think I'm just a character in Alice's Adventures in Wonderland."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 27900,
      "end_ms": 37520,
      "text": "And actually there used to be thousands of us, for real, but now you can only see us in"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 37520,
      "end_ms": 47520,
      "text": "museums. We lived on an island in the Indian Ocean. In the happy old days there was plenty"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 47520,
      "end_ms": 55860,
      "text": "of food to eat. All the other animals were friendly. What a peaceful and safe life."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 55860,
      "end_ms": 68740,
      "text": "However, in 1598 humans arrived. They cut down the trees and our lovely forest was gone."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 70420,
      "end_ms": 81120,
      "text": "They hunted us because we were slow and couldn't fly. What's more, their pigs, cats and dogs"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 81120,
      "end_ms": 93020,
      "text": "eggs ate our eggs! As a result, we soon died out. So today we are standing in museums around"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 93020,
      "end_ms": 102840,
      "text": "the world. When you see us, please remember our sad story. The world is full of fantastic"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 102840,
      "end_ms": 112940,
      "text": "animals, please try your best to help them. Make them as happy as a clam, not as dead as"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 112940,
      "end_ms": 113540,
      "text": "a dodo."
    }
  ],
